<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Comedown</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Leonie Biney</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Comedown</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0VgXzmh9mT3BAgSMjqMonn</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.835" end="00:13.140">Maybe this is me projecting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.140" end="00:15.763">What am I supposed to do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.763" end="00:18.310">I don't wanna be a "cool girl"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.310" end="00:20.631">I'm not really in the mood</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.631" end="00:23.260">I don't really think I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.260" end="00:30.571">I don't really think I like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.571" end="00:33.196">I've been staring at the ceiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.196" end="00:35.728">I've been up in outer space</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.728" end="00:38.059">If I say I like the feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.059" end="00:40.725">Why can't I look at your face?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.725" end="00:43.005">Someone, just give me a reason</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.005" end="00:50.541">Before i go and make another mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.541" end="00:58.541">It hurts now, you're too loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.466" end="01:08.466">I'll blame it on the comedown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.549" end="01:18.093">I don't want a conversation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.093" end="01:20.683">I got nothing left to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.683" end="01:23.228">You can see that I've been vacant</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.228" end="01:25.760">But you look the other way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.760" end="01:28.293">I'll pretend I had a good time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.293" end="01:35.631">Maybe then, I'll see that things start to change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.631" end="01:39.951">It hurts now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.951" end="01:45.431">I'll shut down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.431" end="01:53.431">I'll blame it on the comedown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.308" end="02:18.308">It hurts now, you're too loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.361" end="02:24.361">I'll blame it on the comedown</p></div></body></tt>